"end":11,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m005-0036","start":36,"end":37,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m005-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"a05_brz_8xe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m005-0063","start":63,"end":66,"surface":"朱買臣","kind":"person","person_id":"bvn_k2n_f84","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m005-0068","start":68,"end":69,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m005-0079","start":79,"end":80,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m005-0084","start":84,"end":85,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m005-0117","start":117,"end":118,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"a05_brz_8xe","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin","book_id":"b-shiji-112","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji112-pingjin"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p006","text":"汲黯曰：「弘位在三公，奉祿甚多。然為布被，此詐也。」上問弘。弘謝曰：「有之。夫九卿與臣善者無過黯，然今日庭詰弘，誠中弘之病。夫以三公為布被，誠飾詐欲以釣名。且臣聞管仲相齊，有三歸，侈擬於君，桓公以霸，亦上僭於君。晏嬰相景公，食不重肉，妾不衣絲，齊國亦治，此下比於民。今臣弘位為御史大夫，而為布被，自九卿以下至於小吏，無差，誠如汲黯言。且無汲黯忠，陛下安得聞此言。」天子以為謙讓，愈益厚之。卒以弘為丞相，封平津侯。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"汲黯","kind":"person","person_id":"fmh_dmt_cql","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"a05_brz_8xe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0028","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"黯","kind":"person","person_id":"fmh_dmt_cql","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0054","start":54,"end":55,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"zgg_ncu_lxg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"6ua_ti1_4bc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0106","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"晏嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"811_det_o9f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"i8v_5et_i28","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0135","start":135,"end":136,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0163","start":163,"end":165,"surface":"汲黯","kind":"person","person_id":"fmh_dmt_cql","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0169","start":169,"end":171,"surface":"汲黯","kind":"person","person_id":"fmh_dmt_cql","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0182","start":182,"end":184,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"a05_brz_8xe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0196","start":196,"end":197,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin","book_id":"b-shiji-112","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji112-pingjin"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p008","text":"淮南、衡山謀反，治黨與方急。弘病甚，自以為無功而封，位至丞相，宜佐明主填撫國家，使人由臣子之道。今諸侯有畔逆之計，此皆宰相奉職不稱，恐竊病死，無以塞責。乃上書曰：「臣聞天下之通道五，所以行之者三。曰君臣，父子，兄弟，夫婦，長幼之序，此五者天下之通道也。智，仁，勇，此三者天下之通德，所以行之者也。故曰『力行近乎仁，好問近乎智，知恥近乎勇』。知此三者，則知所以自治；知所以自治，然後知所以治人。天下未有不能自治而能治人者也，此百世不易之道也。今陛下躬行大孝，鑒三王，建周道，兼文武，厲賢予祿，量能授官。今臣弘罷駑之質，無汗馬之勞，陛下過意擢臣弘卒伍之中，封為列侯，致位三公。臣弘行能不足以稱，素有負薪之病，恐先狗馬填溝壑，終無以報德塞責。願歸侯印，乞骸骨，避賢者路。」天子報曰：「古者賞有功，襃德，守成尚文，遭遇右武，未有易此者也。朕宿昔庶幾獲承尊位，懼不能寧，惟所與共為治者，君宜知之。蓋君子善善惡惡，（君宜知之）君若謹行，常在朕躬。君不幸罹霜露之病，何恙不已，乃上書歸侯，乞骸骨，是章朕之不德也。今事少閒，君其省思慮，一精神，輔以醫藥。」因賜告牛酒雜帛。居數月，病有瘳，視事。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m008-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"淮南","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m008-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"衡山","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m008-0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m008-0221","start":221,"end":223,"surface":"陛下","kind":"person","person_id":"a05_brz_8xe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m008-0229","start":229,"end":231,"surface":"三王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m008-0237","start":237,"end":239,"surface":"文武","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m008-0252","start":252,"end":253,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m008-0264","start":264,"end":266,"surface":"陛下","kind":"person","person_id":"a05_brz_8xe","status":"contextual_provisional"},